# Thorin's trigger targets Llanowar Elves and the unattached Sword of the Meek (turn 3); in response Bot2 kills the Elves with
# Lightning Bolt. The Elves are no longer a legal target (CR 608.2b) so there is nothing to attach the Sword to: it stays
# unattached, nothing "becomes attached" and the reflexive ability never triggers (the bare refusal).

